## Acknowledgments

This project was built for OneHack 2025 and incorporates inspiration from:
- NEONSYNC (https://github.com/jayteemoney/neonsync) - Original real-time blockchain game concept
- OneChain - For providing the testnet infrastructure and hackathon opportunity
- Mysten Labs - For the Sui blockchain framework and developer tools
- Phaser - For the game engine

## Additional Notes

This software is provided as an educational hackathon project and should not be used in production without proper security audits and testing.
